'''Timed Stage Reward''' is part of [[Stage Rewards]] which is granted for players who cleared the designated stage with certain scores. First introduced in the [[Cats in Love#Sweetest Sorrow|Sweetest Sorrow]] stages for [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]] for all other versions.

At the time cleared a stage, it's possible to win a scoring reward that has been set for each stage. The rewards are always XP, [[Cat Food]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], Collaboration Units and [[Battle Items]]. In a timed stage, the timer will start when you begin the stage. The rewards are granted only once per crown level and can be given in same time as other common random, special or treasure rewards.

