==Tips==
*Obtaining high scores usually requires aggressive play with maximum effectiveness. Therefore, it is recommended for players to have effective unit formation, maximum unit levels possible, base upgrades and [[Treasure|treasure]] along with experience of playing. Battle oriented [[Battle Items|power-ups]] may be required.
*Power-ups like the 'Cat CPU' may disturb your strategy for the quickest time; so be careful when bringing this power-up.
*The 'Speed Up' power-up won't make you get an advantage in score. In fact, it makes your score go down twice as quick. Be careful when using this power-up.
*Cat Combos that have to do with Worker Cat Up / Starting Money Up generally helps you get cats in battle faster, therefore resulting in a higher score.
*Your timed score starts at 10000, and goes down by about 1 every frame.

